- title: Fuse base dense-gradient writeback into compact recomputation
- difficulty_1_to_5: 4
- description: Extend the compact token kernel so its second hidden-axis pass writes the prediction/correction base gradients while the required inputs are resident. Replace the current full dense-gradient reread with a narrow follow-up pass that adds only active-input and activated RMS/router contributions.
